    "detailed_description": "You are alone on an island, trying desperately to survive amongst the village tribes of savages.<br />\r\nTo do this you need food, water, and shelter.<br />\r\nHunt animals to gather meat.<br />\r\nChop down trees to build a base.<br />\r\nGather resources (stone, iron, sulfur, clay, coal, leather...).<br />\r\nPlant crops, water the planters with a pump and pipes or bucket.<br />\r\nTrap and tame wolves and bears to protect you from enemies.<br />\r\nTame and breed other animals for food or sell them to buy rare items.<br />\r\nMake weapons, armors and potions.<br />\r\nRaid villages or sneak inside to take loot.<br />\r\nPlace traps and defend your base from savages and monsters.<br />\r\nExplore unknown places where enemies are hiding.<br />\r\nSell or buy items in the shop.<br />\r\nFight with big creatures.<br />\r\nHowever take a few moments to enjoy the beauty of the wilderness, but don't be to relaxed.<br />\r\nOther game features:<br />\r\n  Peaceful mode where savages and monsters do not attack you, normal survival mode,<br />\r\n  and a base defense mode where savages attacks more frequently.<br />\r\n  Difficulty customization (Enemies spawning, player health, Resources count, start items).<br />\r\n  Realistic view and hearing for animals, savages, monsters...<br />\r\n  Realistic taming and feeding of the animals.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMost of gameplay videos is with outdated graphics.<br />\r\nThe game will continue to receive updates.",
    "about_the_game": "You are alone on an island, trying desperately to survive amongst the village tribes of savages.<br />\r\nTo do this you need food, water, and shelter.<br />\r\nHunt animals to gather meat.<br />\r\nChop down trees to build a base.<br />\r\nGather resources (stone, iron, sulfur, clay, coal, leather...).<br />\r\nPlant crops, water the planters with a pump and pipes or bucket.<br />\r\nTrap and tame wolves and bears to protect you from enemies.<br />\r\nTame and breed other animals for food or sell them to buy rare items.<br />\r\nMake weapons, armors and potions.<br />\r\nRaid villages or sneak inside to take loot.<br />\r\nPlace traps and defend your base from savages and monsters.<br />\r\nExplore unknown places where enemies are hiding.<br />\r\nSell or buy items in the shop.<br />\r\nFight with big creatures.<br />\r\nHowever take a few moments to enjoy the beauty of the wilderness, but don't be to relaxed.<br />\r\nOther game features:<br />\r\n  Peaceful mode where savages and monsters do not attack you, normal survival mode,<br />\r\n  and a base defense mode where savages attacks more frequently.<br />\r\n  Difficulty customization (Enemies spawning, player health, Resources count, start items).<br />\r\n  Realistic view and hearing for animals, savages, monsters...<br />\r\n  Realistic taming and feeding of the animals.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMost of gameplay videos is with outdated graphics.<br />\r\nThe game will continue to receive updates.",
